tMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 睡：好轉。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 大便暢快，一點裏急後重。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 胃口好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 足溫熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 上半身有燥熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 體力好。("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"師：陽慢慢回頭"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 有些汗，腋下最多。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 手後三指麻，心包最麻。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、 現月經沒來。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、身體："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"背後凸位無了("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"陰證情形轉好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")，喉嚨並無硬塊，無到少陰("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"無立即危險性"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肩井、足三里、大陵、神門、肩禺、合谷、太衝、外關、梁丘、上巨虛"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"本案治則：強心、消導大便。→若睡好、體力好、胃口好，則病不會進→陽回頭，病則不進。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}